    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="purpose">
      <h2 id="purpose">Purpose</h2>
      
      <p>Summarize the synthetic clause governing recurring business-system reviews.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="the-rule">
      <h2 id="the-rule">The rule</h2>
      
      <div class="clause-card-rule">
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Field</th><th scope="col">Value</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Instrument</td><td>FAR codified synthetic rule <a id="cite-ref-1-1" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Codified citation</td><td>48 CFR 9900.101 <a id="cite-ref-1-2" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>RFO citation</td><td>Not established.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Edition date</td><td>2026-01 <a id="cite-ref-1-3" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Text status</td><td>Final synthetic rule <a id="cite-ref-1-4" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a></td></tr>
<tr><td>Applies to</td><td>Fixed-price synthetic awards <a id="cite-ref-1-5" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a></td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>The synthetic clause requires a <span class="term" data-pv="term:system_review" data-pv-title="system review" data-pv-body="Synthetic periodic assessment of business-system control operation.">system review</span> every 30 days <a id="cite-ref-1-6" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0001" data-pv-body="Synthetic compliance reviews occur every 30 days under the synthetic rule." aria-label="Source 1">1</a> and sets a 5 percent <span class="term" data-pv="term:billing_withhold" data-pv-title="billing withhold" data-pv-body="Synthetic retention of a percentage of interim payments pending system correction.">billing withhold</span> <a id="cite-ref-2-1" class="cite-n" href="#cite-2" data-pv="cite:2" data-pv-title="CL-CMP-0002" data-pv-body="Synthetic withholding threshold is 5 percent of billed amounts." aria-label="Source 2">2</a>.</p>

      </div>
      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
      
      <p>Contracting officers apply the synthetic clause to covered awards and monitor the review schedule.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="worked-example">
      <h2 id="worked-example">Worked example</h2>
      
      <p>Synthetic example. The numbers are made up.</p>
<p>A covered contract with 200,000 USD in monthly billings faces a 10,000 USD hold when a deficiency remains open.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="never-confuse">
      <h2 id="never-confuse">Never confuse</h2>
      
      <p>Do not confuse this synthetic clause card with an uncodified agency class deviation.</p>

      
      
    </section>

